{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/park-view-bloom-holding-al-saadiyat-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":686,"crm_id":"603","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Park View","slug":"park-view-bloom-holding-al-saadiyat-island","display_address":"Al Saadiyat island","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready  ","developer":"Bloom Holding","price":726538,"display_price":"726K","lattitude":24.5226365,"longitude":54.3822304,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>\"Park View\" is a complex located on Saadiyat Island, opposite the famous New York University Abu Dhabi. The complex consists of two buildings, the last floors of which are connected to each other by a bridge with a pedestrian area and a swimming pool. In one part of the complex there are 217 hotel rooms, in the other - 230 residential apartments.</p><p>Park View features studios and <strong>1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments</strong> with spacious layouts and luxurious finishes, with modern amenities. All rooms are designed taking into account the requirements of comfort, equipped with kitchen areas, built-in wardrobes, and stylish plumbing. Panoramic windows in combination with light wall decoration visually make the rooms more spacious. On the lower floors of the buildings there are cafes, retail outlets, a children's playground and barbecue areas. With underground parking, 24-hour security, CCTV, concierge and maintenance services, it provides a carefree lifestyle in the heart of Abu Dhabi.</p><p>Buying real estate on Saadiyat Island is a good opportunity to save capital and receive passive income. There are museums, beaches, a golf club, and new complexes and entertainment venues are being built.</p><p>Park View real estate belongs to the budget segment and can bring regular income to the owner. Studios are ideal for students, while apartments are ideal for young couples or families with children.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/603/images/2023/12/11/XzBhnxZGTzkTXZKR03pTTz8UzDChq3nnQ5YIFXcR.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/11/XzBhnxZGTzkTXZKR03pTTz8UzDChq3nnQ5YIFXcR.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/603/images/2023/12/11/0dlpFaCPMiAfVNoosG7TG8PSoWHGNnoVPpn1cvHO.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/11/0dlpFaCPMiAfVNoosG7TG8PSoWHGNnoVPpn1cvHO.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/603/images/2023/12/11/CjGUXKtEMNvFYXLImpyyGCbC94KPM9inHVWykpmL.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/11/CjGUXKtEMNvFYXLImpyyGCbC94KPM9inHVWykpmL.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2663,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/12/11/miktxr4jjKHfVlV2uVXHcxop5Pz8MFBcndoIo3oR.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":885,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1437,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"852 ft²","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Park_View_110e1b5387.jpg","hash":"Park_View_110e1b5387","name":"Park View"},"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1438,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,263 ft²","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Park_View_85af2f478d.jpg","hash":"Park_View_85af2f478d","name":"Park View"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1439,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,587 ft²","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.a